      "quote": "amount you can purchase is 400 Robux for $4.99. The “exchange rate” is slightly more favorable if you decide to purchase more. Alternatively, a paid monthly subscription to [*Roblox* Premium](https://www.roblox.com/premium/membership) includes a monthly deposit of Robux along with a variety of bonus features. *Roblox* Premium ranges in cost from $4.99 per month to $19.99 per month."
